<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Welcome to <%= @app_name %>!</h1>
  
  <p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
  
  <p>Thank you for signing up for <%= @app_name %>! We're excited to have you join our social network.</p>
  
  <p>Here's what you can do with your new account:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Create and share posts with your followers</li>
    <li>Follow other users and see their posts in your feed</li>
    <li>Like and comment on posts</li>
    <li>Customize your profile with a bio and profile picture</li>
  </ul>
  
  <p>Get started by <a href="<%= root_url %>">signing in</a> and exploring the community!</p>
  
  <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
  
  <p>Best regards,<br>
  The <%= @app_name %> Team</p>
  
  <hr>
  <p><small>This email was sent to <%= @user.email %>. You received this email because you signed up for an account on <%= @app_name %>.</small></p>
</body>
</html>
